<div class="q4u-container container py-5"><h1>Privacy & your information</h1><p>This prototype helps Q4U evaluate vehicle administration workflows. Use sample information while testing.</p><h2>What is stored</h2><p>In demo mode, vehicle, request and profile records are held in server memory for up to eight hours or until restart. Uploaded files are stored privately on the development server until cleaned up. Accessibility settings stay in your browser; unfinished new-vehicle and request drafts stay in your current tab until a successful save or sign-out.</p><h2>When Firebase is connected</h2><p>Authentication identifies your account. Q4U workspace records and documents are stored in the configured Firebase project. Access depends on your organisation membership and role. The organisation must establish its retention, deletion and support procedures before accepting real customer information.</p><h2>Corrections or deletion</h2><p>Contact Q4U on <a href="tel:+27118302067">011 830 2067</a> to discuss access, correction or deletion. Account export is available inside the portal. This prototype does not automatically delete an account.</p><p>This is a prototype information notice, not Q4U's final approved privacy policy.</p><a class="secondary" href="/Account/Login">Open portal</a></div>
